                <p>* Sold at Hamburg.</p>
                <p>† Quarantine dues, 39 marks.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Note</hi>.—All of the vessels enumerated in the above
                    statement entered at the port of Hamburg, except the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Mary Sanford</hi>. This vessel made entry at Harburg, a port near Hamburg,
                    where no tonnage duos are exacted. The only tax imposed upon her by the
                    authorities of Hamburg was one of 27.30 marks for harbor and lock dues.</p>
